step("Verify: projects bold+italic to the SGR string 1;3")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val p = resolve_style("paragraph", ["bold", "italic"])
expect(style_to_sgr(p)).to_equal("1;3")
```

</details>

